==Description==

The [[Image:Silk_ControlGrid64_3_1Grid44.svg|32px]] '''Silk ControlGrid64_3_1Grid44''' command creates a ControlGrid64 from a [[Image:Silk_ControlGrid44.svg|16px]] [[Silk_ControlGrid44|ControlGrid44]] selected by one of its corner vertices.

