{{Caption|A ControlGrid44 (select its lower left corner) → Resulting ControlGrid44}}

==Usage==

# Select a [[Image:Silk_ControlGrid44.svg|16px]] [[Silk_ControlGrid44|ControlGrid44]] by one of its corner vertices in the [[3D_View|3DView]].
# There are several ways to invoke the command.
#* Press the {{Button|[[Image:Silk_ControlGrid64_3_1Grid44.svg|16px]] ControlGrid64_3_1Grid44}} button.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Silk → [[Image:Silk_ControlGrid64_3_1Grid44.svg|16px]] ControlGrid64_3_1Grid44}} option from the menu.
# A '''ControlGrid64_3_Grid44''' object, is created.

== Properties ==

See also: [[Property_View|Property View]].

A '''ControlGrid64_3_Grid44''' is derived from a [[...]], formally a {{Incode|yyy}} object and inherits all its properties. It also has the following additional properties:

=== Data ===

{{Properties_Title|ControlGrid64_3_1Grid44}}

* {{PropertyData|ControlGrid44|Link}}: Reference Bezier Surface.
* {{PropertyData|Corner|Float}}: Corner blending curve.
* {{PropertyData|Legs|GeometryList}}: Control segments.
* {{PropertyData|Poles|VectorList}}: Poles.
* {{PropertyData|Weights|FloatList}}: Weights.


